### Maven Build Artifacts and Output
Standard Maven output directory
target/
pom.xml.tag
pom.xml.releaseBackup
pom.xml.versionsBackup
pom.xml.next
release.properties
dependency-reduced-pom.xml
buildNumber.properties
.mvn/timing.properties

Maven Wrapper files (Ignore the binary JAR, keep the wrapper script and properties)
https://maven.apache.org/wrapper/#usage-without-binary-jar
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

Project documentation/metadata often generated by Spring Initializr
HELP.md

### Eclipse/JDT/STS Specific Files
Eclipse Project Files
.project
.classpath
.settings

STS / Spring Specifics
.apt_generated
.factorypath
.springBeans
.sts4-cache

### IntelliJ IDEA Specific Files
.idea
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

### NetBeans Specific Files
/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
/dist/
/nbdist/
/.nb-gradle/
build/

NetBeans specific build exceptions (re-including source files)
!/src/main//build/
!/src/test//build/

### VS Code Specific Files
.vscode/

### Additional Target/Build Exceptions
These lines were included in the merge list, often used to explicitly re-include
source files that might otherwise be incorrectly ignored in multi-module setups.
!/src/main//target/
!/src/test//target/